  "about": {
    "heading": "Six keynotes. Six customers. You call the cues.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Lights Up '28 is Tarnell's customer conference, free for Tarnell customers. Nobody from Tarnell gives a main-stage keynote: the six people on the wall run buses, hospitals, arenas, lifts, breweries and ferries, and they show how they actually do it. Around them, breakouts in The Booth and hands-on labs in the Lab."
    ]
  },
